      "content": "That sounds like a lot of extra construction work and money. If we push for deep soil mixing and all those extra measures, the developer might pull out or ask for massive tax breaks, which would kill the whole economic boost we're looking for. \n\nDo you think the risk is actually significant enough that we *have* to mandate those expensive fixes, or is the report perhaps being overly cautious regarding the actual seismic threat in this area?",
